{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922041840_477db67f","chunk_index":7,"job_id":"mwjob_cffd00bfa3697e3b95523084","precondition_digest":"f483172f30b055a8b1e1a0031ff9bcf82f903ed2e0e2f5846600e2e4c3920808","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v8","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_fc00c21a15e837a8","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_469d7df8436fa4a2","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_503d4369748f76ae","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5cffa5a750f97bfc"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922041840_477db67f","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:ee5efe9041275905ca070eee","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_fc00c21a15e837a8\n章节编号=6.1\n章节标题=试验用药品\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=合成试验药A","quote_sha256":"1e77eea1e13746629978d4d2aea99102d836aea8b61e5d9bfba2651a86cff3d5","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:ee5efe9041275905ca070eee","span_id":"span_pkt_6_1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验药物：合成试验药A\n适应症：成人中重度斑块状银屑病\n研究分期：III期\n开发区域：中国\n内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"143053138b63df4dcc738e4d7c2ca91c3f4320c2cc287f3c8021acb5ca9f698a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_drug"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。\n剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"90ac76022f0172d934f63c349bebb1937d9781f04c1a6d9f78fae1ce5bbe272a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule\n给药途径：口服\n剂型：口服固体制剂\n局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"93d70823288385813f38b773b8c6e7bba227a7ed893796844d8834e9f3bae884","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_form"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_random"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_pkt_6_1","span_proj_drug","span_proj_dose","span_proj_form","span_proj_random"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的试验用药品包括合成试验药A和匹配安慰剂。合成试验药A为小分子口服固体制剂，给药途径为口服，剂量为100 mg，每日一次，自第1天至第16周连续给药。匹配安慰剂为口服制剂，每日一次口服，用于16周双盲治疗期。受试者按1:1随机分配至试验组或对照组，试验组接受合成试验药A，对照组接受匹配安慰剂。试验用药品应由申办者提供，并仅用于参加本研究的受试者。","rationale":"本章基于已确认研究事实：试验药物为合成试验药A，小分子口服固体制剂，100 mg每日一次，第1天至第16周；对照为匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗16周。医学作者需核对：试验用药品的包装、标签具体内容、储存条件、管理职责分工及异常处理流程。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_fc00c21a15e837a8","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ee5efe9041275905ca070eee","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922041840_477db67f","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:ee5efe9041275905ca070eee",